{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一眼落在两行超大号白色标题，随后容易被下方大段文字中的紫色放大词“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”吸引。右侧目录字号较小，底部音符动画亮度较低，不是主要视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"大概是一个很喜欢和对方待在一起、希望对方承诺感情不会改变的人；更具体的关系处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"甜蜜、依恋，同时有不安、担忧和对未来的不确定感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他真正害怕的是有一天对方不再需要自己，因此想收起一些心意来减少受伤，但发现压抑自己的喜欢反而更难受。这层具体矛盾需要看下方大段文字才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"标题讲喜欢相处、渴望不变与担心未来，下方大段才讲害怕不再被需要及想藏起心意，核心处境需要两块拼接。\",\n    \"下方大段本身较长，包含害怕添负担、害怕失去需要、想少表达心意、压抑后更难受等多层意思。\",\n    \"放大的紫色词句“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”本身不能独立说明具体处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "555bc4ee-496c-4a8f-b36d-8e5289e7f32b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012008322130Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:20:41.662884+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2338fafbf1d90e2b6f2e1fc2258ac4d89d417dc0ade21fdc4b79d60e16857b26", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012008322130Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e772eb927084c7591ffeb8ef1fe46240c7da6c05d13fa4938bdbbad6af1f268d"}}}
